&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (3) Apply sealant and RTV to seal the connection.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (4) Wait for the curing time and monitor for leakage.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (5) Perform function test and found no leak.</p><p><br></p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\115 LQM Utility\\2024\\2024-05-27 TS Common Toilet Flushing Valve Malfunction">\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\115 LQM Utility\\2024\\2024-05-27 TS Common Toilet Flushing Valve Malfunction</a><br></p>', '2024-05-27 18:15:24', '2024-09-07 18:38:33', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Cmms-Tech', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
