sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 26.09 VDC and 15.1 A at 3:40 PM.<br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History:15-06-2024</span></div><div><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action&nbsp; &nbsp; : Preapred to charge wellhead hybrid battery bank for replacement.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Arranged batteries connector cable and setting up for charging batteries.(Completed)</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Charging can be started from tomorrow.</span></p></div>', NULL, '2024-06-16 15:59:47', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
