p;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Activity:&nbsp;To assist PMO/E for wind turbine ZTK-MOD-22010</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action: Supported the PMO/E team to install the wind sensor at helideck</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; But cannot install at helideck location&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Installed infront of EI Room.</span></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-06-17_assist PMOE for wind turbine ZTK-MOD-22010', '2024-06-17 16:18:21', '2024-06-17 23:46:30', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
