;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 26.25 VDC and 15.7 A at 3:40 PM.</span></div></div><div><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></u></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">15-06-2024</span></div><div><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Today action</u></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Perform charging the hybrid battery and measure the parameter before charging and during charging.<br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Charging parameter is following as:</span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Before charging : 24.84 VDC at 9:45 AM.</span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Start charging&nbsp; &nbsp; : 25.11 VDC and 30.7 A at 9:45 AM.<br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 26.09 VDC and 15.1 A at 3:40 PM.</span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History:15-06-2024</span></div><div><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action&nbsp; &nbsp; : Preapred to charge wellhead hybrid battery bank for replacement.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Arranged batteries connector cable and setting up for charging batteries.(Completed)</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Charging can be started from tomorrow.</span></p></div>', NULL, '2024-06-19 16:00:09', CURRENT