"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Plan: Continue to perform overhaul for valve internal parts.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History:15-06-2024</span></p><p><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Today Action</u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Remove the actuator from the valve body.<br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Remove the actuator cylinder and disassemble the internal parts.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Clean the all internal assembly and perform visual check.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Replace yoke O-ring, piston O-ring and actuator stem O-ring.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Job progress-10% completed.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Plan: Continue to reinstall back all assembly internal part of the actuator. After that, will install back to valve body.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History: 14-06-2024<br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action: Prepare and check the spare part repair kits of second stage anti surge valve&nbsp;(FV-4X530).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Transfer the anti surge valve from transformer area to the workshop to overhaul.<br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Remove the instrument tubing, smart positoner, volume booster and positoner indicator.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Job progress&nbsp;5% completed.<br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Plan: Continue to remove the vave and actuator assembly. And will replace repair kit and perform calibration and function test.&nbsp;</span></p>', NULL, '2024-06-22 15:01:01', '2024-06-22 15:49:41', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
