sp; Showed that "The operation has timed out" message.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Performed hard reset and tightened all connections.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; And performed transmitter test again.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Showed that "The operation has timed out" message.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Communication is lost between sand monitoring server and sand probes.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Changed RS232 female socket from Port 4 to Port 1 at WP13 Interface Intelligence Unit.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Performed remote acess to WP13 IIU sand monitoring server.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Opened Microcor Driver Setup.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Changed "Serial Port" from "COM4" to "COM1" for all transmitters. (XT-13x13).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Performed "Transmitter Test" and "Transmitter Test" shows "The operation has timed out"</span></p>', '<p>\\\\pttep.com\\DFSRootZPQ\\zpqshare\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\01 Automation\\01. Picture and Document for History Report\\Hand Over Rev.53 (25 Jun to 25 Jul 24)\\2024-07-10_WP 13 Sand monitoring system</p><p>\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-07-10_ZTK-WP13-XT, TS Sand Monitoring system malfunction<br></p>', '2024-07-10 15:05:11', '2024-07-15 16:34:13', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
