oming line pressure.</span></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\15-08-2024_PT09101, Replaced the defective transmitter', '2024-08-15 15:20:13', '2024-08-15 21:46:36', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Cmms-Tech', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
