e the pump as per procedure.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (2) Remove the O-ring and clean the shaft parts.</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; New Bearing Marking,</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Outboard Bearing&nbsp;: SKF 305EC GERMANY 018P EXPLORER (Outer ring)</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: NUP 305 ECJ GERMANY 018P EXPLORER (Plate)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:SKF NUP 305 ECJ GERMANY 018P EXPLORER (Inner Ring)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;M.E.S.C = 42.70.06.027.3</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Inboard Bearing&nbsp;: GT BRITIAN 20 316SWR SKF EXPLORER SKF 22206 EIC3&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; M.E.S.C = 42.70.06.029.3</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\66 SERVICE WATER &amp; SEA WATER\\X-6625\\2024\\2024-09-09 Overhaul HP pump">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\66 SERVICE WATER &amp; SEA WATER\\X-6625\\2024\\2024-09-09 Overhaul HP pump</a><br></p>', '2024-09-09 18:06:16', '2024-09-17 18:25:25', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
