ained about Motion Control Modules</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Next: Conduct Allen Bradely PLC In-house training day 2</span></p>', '\\\\pttep.com\\DFSRootZPQ\\zpqshare\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\01 Automation\\01. Picture and Document for History Report\\Hand Over Rev.55 (15 Aug to 25 Sep 24)\\2024-09-10_Day2 PLC In-house training', '2024-09-10 13:07:18', '2024-09-10 16:12:43', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
