&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; - PASS : Sol@rTT4000!</p><p>Plan: For GTC-4400,already sent email to engineer how to logon.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;When we can logon, we will changeover vent fan.</p><p><b>Excel Link:&nbsp;<i>\\\\pttep.com\\DFSRootZPQ\\zpqshare\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\02 EI-Turbine\\10 Follow up GTG_GTC Job list\\07 Monthly Ventilation Fan Changeover\\2024</i></b></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '2024-09-13 16:33:18', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
