inding</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: To replace indicator lamps (2 Ea) at Battery charger Ex JB.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;: To measure battery resistance and voltage.<br></p><p><br></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-09-15_BDG-7205_1Y PM_EL BDG Black Start Diesel Generator', '2024-09-15 15:34:44', '2024-09-15 18:30:18', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
