sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-09-17_GTC-4400 Decommissioning Vaccum System From Gearbox">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-09-17_GTC-4400 Decommissioning Vaccum System From Gearbox</a><br></p>', '2024-09-17 19:21:15', '2024-09-18 08:35:23', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Turbine', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Turbine', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
