- Progress is 50%.</span></p><p><br></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-09-18_GTC-4400, Perform 8K PM_EL', '2024-09-18 15:25:45', '2024-09-18 16:22:38', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
