sp; Job completed.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-09-23_PT-01P09_To implement for ZTK-SMD-24010 of PT-01P09', '2024-09-23 15:28:40', '2024-10-30 10:15:55', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
