><b><u>Trial -4 (run with diesel)</u></b><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;-Start time 16:20 - 16:30 without load. (Duration is 10mins)</p><p>&nbsp;-Engine condition is normal.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><br><p><br></p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\102 PORTABLE EQUIPMENTS\\Mobile Gen DG-WP-452\\2024\\2024-09-30 Trail run with Diesel n Condy">\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\102 PORTABLE EQUIPMENTS\\Mobile Gen DG-WP-452\\2024\\2024-09-30 Trail run with Diesel n Condy</a><br></p>', '2024-09-30 22:55:05', '2024-11-15 10:01:42', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-TeamL', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
