(255, 255, 0);">Activity: ProSafe Inhouse Training to EI team from automation.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Topic cover,</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Explained System overview architecture of Prosafe RS.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Introduced Prosafe RS hardware.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Explained communication setup for both Computer and Hardware setup.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Introduced attendants to Zawtika SIS and FGS system compare with training document.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">-Create new project at training station and setup Domain and Station properties.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>', '<p><a href="Y:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\01 Automation\\01. Picture and Document for History Report\\Hand Over Rev.56 (11 Sep 24 to 15 Oct 24)\\2024-10-01_Prosafe RS Training Day3">Y:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\01 Automation\\01. Picture and Document for History Report\\Hand Over Rev.56 (11 Sep 24 to 15 Oct 24)\\2024-10-01_Prosafe RS Training Day3</a><br></p>', '2024-10-01 15:27:25', '2024-10-02 08:52:48', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
