;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; Plan to check transformer SCR and wiring for tomorrow.</span></p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-10-06_X-6640, TS Rectifier fault', '2024-10-06 15:52:33', '2024-10-06 17:31:09', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
