; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; survey for psv installation process).</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-accumulator No.2 rapture disc is bursted</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-accumulator No.3 found raputure disc is bursted and install from no 5 and charged 85&nbsp; bar&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - accumulator No.4 is working good condition (96 barN2 pressure)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -accumulator No.5 bladder damaged</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -accumulator No.6 bladder damaged</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-clean the strainer from exhust sea water cooling line.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\67 FIRE WATER SYSTEM\\P-6700 Diesel Fire Water Pump Package No. 1\\2024\\2024-10-10 6MPM">\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\67 FIRE WATER SYSTEM\\P-6700 Diesel Fire Water Pump Package No. 1\\2024\\2024-10-10 6MPM</a><br></p>', '2024-10-11 15:05:59', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
