E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-10-25_PT-15J07, TS PRCA-15J07 abnormal pressure rate change).</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-100% completed.</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-10-25_PT-15J07, TS PRCA-15J07 abnormal pressure rate change', '2024-10-25 15:48:49', '2024-11-04 19:05:37', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
