round-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);">WP12-401</span> Red Flashing Beacon (<span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);">Avaliable</span>)</p><p>- <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">WP12-402</span> Red Flashing Beacon (<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Remove wire</span>)</p><p>- <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">WP12-407</span> Red Flashing Beacon (<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Not avaliable</span>)</p><p><b><u>Next plan</u>,</b></p><p>-Will order the spare and replace with the same type.</p><p><b><u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>-N/A</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>- 50% in progress&nbsp;</p>', NULL, '2024-10-28 23:17:19', '2025-01-15 17:23:55', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
