k lists signed by operator and comapny man</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>- 100% completed.</p>', '<p><a href="U:\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-11-03_ HS-06906, WP-06, Platform handover and install ESD-1 hand switches">U:\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-11-03_ HS-06906, WP-06, Platform handover and install ESD-1 hand switches</a><br></p>', '2024-11-04 13:21:01', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
