rrestor maintenance.</p><p>-Checked the the switching signal of the solenoids. (Got signal activation).</p><p><b><u>As left</u>,</b></p><p>-PM job is already completed.&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>Next plan</u>,</b></p><p>-Need to troubleshoot CM for solenoid switching.</p><p><b><u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>-Link(\\\\pttep.com\\DFSRootZPQ\\zpqshare\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\01 PM Records and Test Records\\27. ZPQ Analyzers\\2024\\Dew Point Analyzer</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>-100%</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-11-13_AT-46010, 1Y PM on dew point analyzer">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2024-11-13_AT-46010, 1Y PM on dew point analyzer</a><br></p>', '2024-11-13 16:05:50', '2025-09-09 21:55:40', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Turbine', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
