<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></p><p>- NA.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-NA.</p><p>-Link ().</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>- 100%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025.02.03_TEG-0395H, TS TEG cannot start', '2025-02-03 21:45:43', '2025-02-04 07:06:03', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
