<u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>-NA</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u>-Note:</u>&nbsp; While manual test run from Local control switch, found The local name tag plate of hand switch ventilation fan LCS-M4297A was labeled as "B" and vent fan B was labeled as "A". </p><p>-Verified the real loop from PLC command and all loops are normal by cross checked with CCR.</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>-GTC-Train1 MCC drawers'' completion: 100%</p><p>-53% overall (Total Units: 96 nos., Completed Units: 51 nos.) so far.</p>', NULL, '2025-04-21 15:05:37', '2025-05-29 15:58:14', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
