nd exercised the damper by manually.</p><p>- Function test and it able to close when fire &amp; gas signal activated.</p><p><u><b>As left,</b></u></p><p>- NA</p><p><u><b>Next Plan,</b></u></p><p>- Unit is available.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>- NA.</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>- 100% complete</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>History 20 Apr 2025</u></b></p><p>- Perform 1Y PM activity as per the procedure.</p><p>- Check the cable tightness and apply grease to the cover of instruments as per the lists.</p><p>- Function test and monitor the alarm at local, UCP panel and Eagle quantum controller during testing of heat detectors.</p><p>- Strobe lamp and warning siren are activated during heat detector simulation.</p><p>- Found that the water mist nozzles near the enclosure air inlet damper is rusty.</p><p>- Cleaned all the water mist nozzles.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-04-22_GTG-7220 8KPM Fire &amp; Gas System', '2025-04-22 17:28:42', '2025-05-18 09:49:56', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
