n. (OK and Completed)</i></p><p>-MCC-CPP-7220, M-7224-1, Ventilation System Motor 2 (Completed)</p><p><b><u>As left</u>,</b></p><p>- NA</p><p><b><u>Next plan</u>,</b></p><p>-Need to perform function test.</p><p>- Continue to upgrade the remaining MCC drawers.</p><p><b><u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>-NA</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>-Will complete 100% today for GTG-7220. (4 out of 6 completed so far)</p><p>-59.3% overall (Total Units: 96 nos., Completed Units: 57 nos.) so far.</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-04-24_LTMR, Upgrade LTMR firmware to 3.0 for GTG train 2">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-04-24_LTMR, Upgrade LTMR firmware to 3.0 for GTG train 2</a><br></p>', '2025-04-24 15:44:14', '2025-05-29 15:58:02', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
