</u></b><b>,</b></p>  <p>- NA</p>  <p><b><u>Next plan</u></b><b>,</b></p>  <p>- N/A</p>  <p><b><u>Documentation</u></b><b>,</b></p>  <p><br></p><p>- G:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\01 PM Records and Test Records\\09. Gas Turbine Generator (GTG-72X0)\\2025\\GTG-7220</p>  <p><b><u>Job progress</u></b><b>,</b></p>  <p>- 100% completed.</p>  <p>&nbsp;</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-04-25_GTG-7220 K PM Electrical System', '2025-04-25 15:47:52', '2025-04-28 16:12:47', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
