10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-05-08_PT-12X07, TS transmitter reading cannot adjust to zero">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-05-08_PT-12X07, TS transmitter reading cannot adjust to zero</a><br></p>', '2025-05-08 22:20:52', '2025-05-08 22:33:34', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
