point for the sequence of Air Dryer Package.</p><p><br></p><p><b>19 May 2025:</b></p><p><u>Action</u></p><p>- Visual check inside the enclosure for any air leakage by thermal scanner. No Leakage found.</p><p>- Check lube oil level at sight glass. (90%).</p><p>- Check Air, lube oil cooler fin tubes for any cloggage.&nbsp;</p><p>- Monitoring and comparing Lube oil temp of Air compressor A/C.</p><p><br></p><table class="table table-bordered"><tbody><tr><td>10:48AM (wind-SSW)</td><td>Mode</td><td>Status</td><td>TT-65004 (C)</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp A</td><td>Lag-1</td><td>LOAD</td><td>48.56</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp C</td><td>Lead</td><td>LOAD</td><td>45.7</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><table class="table table-bordered"><tbody><tr><td>01:51PM (wind-SSW)</td><td>Mode</td><td>Status</td><td>TT-65004 (C)</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp A</td><td>Lag-1</td><td>LOAD</td><td>44.50</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp C</td><td>Lead</td><td>LOAD</td><td>45.04</td></tr></tbody></table><table class="table table-bordered"><tbody><tr><td>02:12PM (wind-S)</td><td>Mode</td><td>Status</td><td>TT-65004 (C)</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp A</td><td>Lead</td><td>LOAD</td><td>45.27</td></tr><tr><td>Air Comp C</td><td>Lag-1</td><td>LOAD</td><td>45.49</td></tr></tbody></table><p>- Let the compressor-A running with Lead mode and monitoring lube oil temp. Lube oil temp is within normal range.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><u>Remark</u></p><p>-Wind direction may effect the Air Comp package due to restriction of air flow.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ&nbsp; MECH&nbsp; HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\65 INSTRUMENT AIR, UTILITY AIR &amp; N2\\6501 Instrument Air Compressors\\A-6500 A\\2025\\2025-05-19 TS lube oil temp high', '2025-05-19 15:23:03', '2025-07-13 17:54:23', 'PTTEP\\Z