<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></p><p>-NA.</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-100% completed</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-05-24_SDV-62501, TS valve is malfunction', '2025-05-24 17:57:17', '2025-05-25 21:01:33', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
