side the accumulator and equipment.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Reinstate new bladder to the accumulator.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Install new seal kit for liquid port.</p><p><br></p><p><u>30-May-25&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Reinstall accumulator no.3.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Recharged Nitrogen pressure ( 103 barg).</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perform fire water pump test run and hydraulic charging accumulator 3,6 around 200 barg.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Monitoring for any leak and any abnormal.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Unit is available.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\67 FIRE WATER SYSTEM\\P-6720 Diesel Fire Water Pump Package No. 3\\2025\\2025-05-28 Replaced the defective bladder No3 &amp; 6" target="_blank">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\67 FIRE WATER SYSTEM\\P-6720 Diesel Fire Water Pump Package No. 3\\2025\\2025-05-28 Replaced the defective bladder No3 &amp; 6</a><br></p>', '2025-05-28 18:04:44', '2025-06-01 09:47:37', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-TeamL', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
