pment/Tool status,</b></u></p><p>-N/A</p><p><u><b>Next Plan,</b></u></p><p>-N/A</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-G:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\01 PM Records and Test Records\\29. ZPQ On-Off Valves Function Test\\Blow Down Valve\\2025</p><p>-G:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\01 PM Records and Test Records\\29. ZPQ On-Off Valves Function Test\\Shutdown Valve\\2025</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-100% completed</p><p><u><b>Job status</b></u></p><p>-BDV= 13 out of 13 (100% completed)</p><p>-SDV= 2 out of 2 (100% completed)</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-06-05_1YPM on off valve in ZPQ">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-06-05_1YPM on off valve in ZPQ</a><br></p>', '2025-06-05 15:54:28', '2025-06-09 13:30:29', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
