p>-Spare parts available on hand for emergency battery and plan to replace asap.</p><p>-Create CM Work order to rectify 1MPM findings.</p><p>-WO 500625897</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-Link (G:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\01 PM Records and Test Records\\06. Free Fall Life Boat\\2025\\1MPM\\06.June)</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-100% completed.</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-06-05_Life boat,1MPM free fall life boat', '2025-06-05 16:24:16', '2025-06-08 07:10:54', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
