eted)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Total completed&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = 94.36%&nbsp;(132 out of 141 completed)</p><p>-Job is still in progress</p><p><u><b>Material/Equipment/Tool status,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u><b>Next plan,</b></u></p><p>-Plan to continue for GDU area.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></p><p>-94.36%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-07-12_ZTK-SFGS-GD,1YPM Gas Detectors (Point type and Open Path)', '2025-07-12 17:42:21', '2025-07-12 17:52:09', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
