formed unit changeover and monitored unit.</div><div><br></div><div><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></div><div>-N/A</div><div>-Link ()</div><div><br></div><div><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></div><div>-80%</div>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-07-14_MOV-86505, TS MOV fail to close', '2025-07-14 15:40:52', '2025-07-15 17:05:36', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
