<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></p><p>-Spare Aviation Lamp keep back on EI store.</p><p><b><u>Next plan</u>,</b></p><p>-To replace with the new complete aviation lighting set on next visit.</p><p>-Need to request crane operator and scaffolding for proper installation.</p><p>-Need to bring extra cable 3Cx2.5mm2 (2 meters) with JB for cable re-installation after cut the cable on existing lighting.&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>-NA.</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>-50%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-08-06_CR-0273, TS crane aviation light malfunction', '2025-08-06 20:45:35', '2025-08-06 20:55:38', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
