l drawing for Well01E.</p><p>-Need to add graphic for Well01E.&nbsp;</p>  <p><b><u>Documentation,</u></b></p>  <p>-N/A</p>  <p>-Link ()</p>  <p><b><u>Job progress,</u></b></p>  <p>-80%</p>', NULL, '2025-08-28 15:57:45', '2025-09-09 10:51:59', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
