 be monitored from Field watch server.</p>  <p><b><u>Material/Equipment/Tool status,</u></b></p>  <p>-N/A</p>  <p><b><u>Next plan,</u></b></p>  <p>-Need to perform zero erosion offset if needed.</p>  <p><b><u>Documentation,</u></b></p>  <p>-</p>  <p>-Link ()</p>  <p><b><u>Job progress,</u></b></p>  <p>-90%</p>', NULL, '2025-08-29 16:05:43', '2025-09-05 07:40:04', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
