tres size follow as common tread type.</p>', '2025-09-08 21:10:49', '2025-09-09 01:19:04', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
