u><b>Next plan,</b></u></p><p>-Will plan to troubleshoot the chilled water pump unit B, P-7810B and created <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">WO500650773.</span></p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-G:\\Department Share\\04_MAINTENANCE\\03 E&amp;I\\08 PM&amp;CM&amp;Log Sheets Report\\04 Log sheets\\HVAC LOG SHEET\\HVAC Logsheet 2025</p><p><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></p><p>-100% completed.</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-10-09_Monthly HVAC log sheet">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-10-09_Monthly HVAC log sheet</a><br></p>', '2025-10-09 17:26:01', '2025-10-10 07:54:23', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
