ued to perform Running New sand Server &amp; Existing Server then verify communication status and Field Watch configuration&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Continued to perform new sand server function testing (Data comparison test between new sand server and existing sand server of Z1A, Z1B, Z1C and Z1D)</li><li><br></li><li><u><font color="#0000ff">Back up and Updated HMI configuration for WP-01 to WP-15.</font></u></li><li><u><font color="#0000ff"><br></font></u></li><li><font color="#ff00ff">-Performed online download for OPS station at CCR.(Completed)</font></li><li><font color="#ff00ff">-Checked communication link between PLC gateway and Fast tool.(Completed)</font></li><li><font color="#ff00ff">-Add New tag for WP-16 to WP-19 at PLC gateway.(Completed)</font></li><li><br></li><li>-Performed online uploading existing running HMI configuration file.</li><li>-Compared existing configuration HMI with Updated one.</li><li><br></li></ul><p></p><p><u><b>As left,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u>Next Plan,</u></p><p>-Continue Z1E-Brownfield modification.</p><p><u>Documentation,</u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u>Job Progress,</u></p><p>-InProgress</p>', NULL, '2025-10-16 15:59:16', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
