ng Server then verify communication status and Field Watch configuration&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Continued to perform new sand server function testing (Data comparison test between new sand server and existing sand server of Z1A, Z1B, Z1C and Z1D)</li><li><br></li><li><u><font color="#0000ff">Back up and Updated HMI configuration for WP-01 to WP-15</font>.</u></li><li><u><br></u></li><li>-Performed online download for OPS station at CCR.(Completed)</li><li>-Checked communication link between PLC gateway and Fast tool.(Completed)</li><li>-Add New tag for WP-16 to WP-19 at PLC gateway.(Completed)</li><li>-Performed online uploading existing running HMI configuration file.</li><li>-Compared existing configuration HMI with Updated one.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><u><font color="#0000ff">PLC Gateway Implementation for WP-16 t oWP-19</font></u></p><p><br></p><p>-Performed function test between WP-16 ,PLC Gateway and SCADA system.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &gt; Function Test Signal dry test for ESD1A as per PLC logic.(Completed)</p><p>-Performed function test between WP-18 , PLC Gateway and SCADA System.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &gt; Function Test Signal dry test for ESD1A as per PLC logic (Completed).</p><p></p><p><u><b>As left,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u><b>Next Plan</b>,</u></p><p>-Continue Z1E-Brownfield modification.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-InProgress</p>', NULL, '2025-10-18 15:38:04', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
