ring and configure communication routing</li></ul><ul><li>Continued to perform OPC Tags import and re-alight address for PI system &amp; Alarm</li></ul><p>management system&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><font color="#0000ff"><u>ZPQ New sand server system installation and existing sand server migration</u>&nbsp;</font></p><p>-<font color="#ff00ff">Check Data mapping between New Sand Server and SCADA system.</font></p><p><font color="#ff00ff">-Check Data conversion calculation between SCADA system and Sand Server.</font></p><p>History,</p><p>Connect LAN cable at SCADA PLC Gateway Cabinet.</p><p>Waiting to perform function test and communication test between SCADA 1D and New Sand Server.</p><ul><li>Continued to perform Running New sand Server &amp; Existing Server then verify communication status and Field Watch configuration&nbsp;</li></ul><ul><li>Continued to perform new sand server function testing (Data comparison test between new sand server and existing sand server of Z1A, Z1B, Z1C and Z1D)</li><li><br></li><li><u><font color="#0000ff">Back up and Updated HMI configuration for WP-01 to WP-15.</font></u></li><li><u><br></u></li><li>-Performed online download for OPS station at CCR.(Completed)</li><li>-Checked communication link between PLC gateway and Fast tool.(Completed)</li><li>-Add New tag for WP-16 to WP-19 at PLC gateway.(Completed)</li><li>-Performed online uploading existing running HMI configuration file.</li><li>-Compared existing configuration HMI with Updated one.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><u><font color="#0000ff">PLC Gateway Implementation for WP-16 t oWP-19</font></u></p><p><br></p><p><font color="#ff00ff">-Performed function test between WP-17,PLC gateway and SCADA System.</font></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &gt;<font color="#ff00ff">Function test completed for ESD1A at WP-16 as per PLC logic.(Completed)</font></p><p><font color="#ff00ff">-Performed function test between WP-19,PLC gateway and SCADA System.</font></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &gt;<font color="#ff00ff">Function 