st AUX hoist.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Job complete.</p><p><br></p><p><u>2025-11-23&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;</p><p>- Prepare water bag and load cell for load test.</p><p>- Inspection team inspected aux block hook diameter and any crack or not.</p><p>- Performed aux block load test at 3 T and 5 T.</p><p>-After load test finished, Inspection team inspected again aux block hook diameter and any crack or not.</p><p>- Boom lay on roof deck and inspect the boom tip sheave and snap ring condition.</p><p>- Crane is back to service now.</p><p>-</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\02 ZWP\\ZPQ\\2025\\2025-11-22 Replace AUX wire rope">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ&nbsp; MECH&nbsp; HISTORY PICTURE\\02 ZWP\\ZPQ\\2025\\2025-11-23 Perform pull test after aux wire rope and sheave replacement</a><br></p>', '2025-11-22 16:48:45', '2025-11-23 17:03:26', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Cmms-Tech', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-TeamL', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
