E Team for SCADA Radio communication</a><br></p>', '2025-11-23 23:08:51', '2025-11-24 18:02:24', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
