>- T/S the crane cannot stop by normal stop button.</p><p><b><u>Documentation</u>,</b></p><p>- N/A</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><b><u>Job progress</u>,</b></p><p>-100%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-11-23_CR-1873,To perform crane CR-1873 function test', '2025-11-24 00:29:29', '2025-11-25 12:28:23', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
