os\\05-ZPQ&nbsp; MECH&nbsp; HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\77 SAFETY LIVE SAVING &amp; PORTABLE FIRE FIGHTING EQUIPMENT\\SC - 7730\\2025', '2025-11-24 18:17:50', '2025-11-25 17:16:31', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Cmms-Tech', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Crane', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
