misaligned with valve flanges.</span></p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\02 ZWP\\ZWP13\\VB F16C Installed 8 inch ball valve\\2025-11-25" target="_blank">\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\02 ZWP\\ZWP13\\VB F16C Installed 8 inch ball valve\\2025-11-25</a><br></p>', '2025-11-25 20:20:14', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
