sp; Housekeeping and cleaning the area.</p>', '<p><a href="http://\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\77 SAFETY LIVE SAVING &amp; PORTABLE FIRE FIGHTING EQUIPMENT\\SC - 7740\\2025\\2025-11-26 1Y PM">\\\\10.15.131.205\\maint-share\\Maintenance_Moved_from_UnOfficialShare\\Mechanical Photos\\05-ZPQ  MECH  HISTORY PICTURE\\01 ZPQ\\77 SAFETY LIVE SAVING &amp; PORTABLE FIRE FIGHTING EQUIPMENT\\SC - 7740\\2025\\2025-11-26 1Y PM</a><br></p>', '2025-11-26 18:03:14', '2025-11-27 16:19:02', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Crane', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Mechanical-Works', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
