, Multimeter display is 12.5mA.</p><p>- Pressure calibrator reading is 240 bar. PT reading is 0 bar, PT AO is 16mA, Multimeter display is 16.4mA.</p><p>- Pressure calibrator reading is 320&nbsp; bar. PT reading is 0 bar, PT AO is 20mA, Multimeter display is 20.21mA</p><p>-Transmitter HART mA communication output card is malfunction.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><u><b>As left,</b></u></p><p>-</p><p><u><b>Next plan,</b></u></p><p>-For PT-15D07 and PT-15E07 will simulate at HMI station once automation team ready</p><p>-For PT-15J07, need to replace new HART mA communication card</p><p><u><b>Materials, tools and spare parts status</b></u></p><p>-Temporary kept at Shelf H-3 with tag and marking.&nbsp;</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></p><p>-70%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-11-30_PT-15D07_PT-15E07_PT-15J07_To simulate PT-15x07', '2025-11-30 17:20:06', '2025-11-30 18:25:03', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
