system.</p><p>4.Pre-PAHH-07201 A/B/C is 60 Barg (Pre High High) in SCADA system.</p><p>5.PAHH-07201 A/B/C is 63 Barg (High High) in PLC and 63 Barg (High High) in SCADA system</p><p><br></p><p><u>As left,</u></p><p>- Alarm setpoints for PT-07201 A/B/C are already set to its original alarm set point as mentioned in P&amp;ID according to the production engineer requested</p><p><u>Material/Equipment/Tool status,</u></p><p>-N/A</p><p><u>Next plan,</u></p><p>-N/A</p><p><u>Documentation,</u></p><p>-NA</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u>Job progress,</u></p><p>-100%</p>', NULL, '2025-12-11 10:02:27', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.Automation', NULL, false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
