ol status,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p><u><b>Next plan,</b></u></p><p>-To reinstall EI equipment.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-NA</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></p><p>-30%.</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-12-28_GTC-4400, TT6 upgrade and engine change out activity', '2025-12-28 18:19:14', '2025-12-28 18:29:35', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
