 <p><b><u>As left,</u></b></p>  <p>-Unit kept running &amp; under monitoring.</p>  <p><b><u>Material/Equipment/Tool status,</u></b></p>  <p>- Tools bag &amp; some equipment kept at GDU skid.</p>  <p><b><u>Next plan,</u></b></p>  <p>- N/A</p>  <p><b><u>Documentation,</u></b></p>  <p>- N/A</p>  <p>-Link ()</p>  <p><b><u>Job progress,</u></b></p>  <p>-90%</p>', NULL, '2025-12-30 22:29:10', '2025-12-30 22:43:35', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-TeamLead', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
