ogress.</p><p>-Link&nbsp;</p><p><u><b>Job Progress,</b></u></p><p>-90%</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2026-01-03_ESDV-40202, SDV-40215, HCV-40216 12M PM SD Inlet Manifold &amp; WP2 Pig Receiver', '2026-01-03 22:34:03', '2026-01-03 23:13:08', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Workshop', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
