idth="954" valign="top">   <p>EI team checked 2nd stage anti-surge valve performance by valve   link software.</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>13:10pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Pressurized and started the unit GTC-4400.</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>13:45pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Both 1st and 2nd stage anti-surge valves are fully   closed/Opened. (Command and feedback are same)</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>14:50pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Unit tripped&nbsp;by HPC   possible reverse flow condition check alarm (FSLO).</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>15:45pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Unit start again and Onload at 16:11pm.</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>16:57pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Unit tripped&nbsp;again by   HPC possible reverse flow condition check alarm (FSLO).</p>   </td>  </tr>  <tr>   <td width="119" valign="top">   <p>17:05pm</p>   </td>   <td width="954" valign="top">   <p>Unit start and continue to check the root cause of Unit tripped.</p>   </td>  </tr> </tbody></table><p><u><b>As left,</b></u></p><p>-N/A</p><p><u><b>Material/Equipment/Tool status,</b></u></p><p>-</p><p><u><b>Next plan,</b></u></p><p>-Continue to monitor the unit running abnormal alarm.</p><p><u><b>Documentation,</b></u></p><p>-</p><p>-Link ()</p><p><u><b>Job progress,</b></u></p><p>-Refer PMO/E report.</p>', '\\\\10.15.131.205\\Maint-Share\\01 E&amp;I\\Activity Photos\\2025-01-04_GTC-4400, TT6 upgrade and engine changeout activity', '2026-01-04 22:01:15', '2026-01-04 22:19:15', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Turbine', 'PTTEP\\ZPQ.EI-Turbine', false, 'ZTK') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
